    "modifier_marci_7_1": "During Unleash, using other abilities creates a Pulse. \n\n Unleash Pulses silence enemies for <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> sec. \n\n Works through Magic Immunity. \n\n Strength: <b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b>",
