    "modifier_marci_14_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Unleash does not increase Attack Speed. </font></b> \n\n Unleash becomes a Passive Ability. \n\n Removes the delay between Unleash combos.",
    "modifier_marci_14_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Unleash does not increase Attack Speed. </font></b> \n\n Unleash becomes a Passive Ability. \n\n Removes the <b><font color='#eabe10'>delay</font></b> between Unleash combos.",
    "modifier_marci_15_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Unleash. </font></b> \n\n Health: 100/150/200 \n\n New Active Ability: Beautiful Illusion \n\n There is never too much beauty! Creates a hero illusion. \n\n Max Illusions: 1 \n Illusion Damage: 50%/75%/100% \n Damage Taken by Illusion: 100% \n Duration: 20 sec. \n Cooldown: 10 sec. \n Mana Cost: 50",
