    "modifier_marci_15_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Unleash. </font></b> \n\n Health: 100/<b><font color='#eabe10'>150</font></b>/200 \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Beautiful Illusion</font></b> \n\n There is never too much beauty! Creates a hero illusion. \n\n Max Illusions: 1 \n Illusion Damage: 50%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>75%</font></b>/100% \n Damage Taken by Illusion: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> \n Duration: 20 sec. \n Cooldown: 10 sec. \n Mana Cost: 50",
    "modifier_marci_15_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Unleash. </font></b> \n\n Health: 100/150/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Beautiful Illusion</font></b> \n\n There is never too much beauty! Creates a hero illusion. \n\n Max Illusions: 1 \n Illusion Damage: 50%/75%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> \n Damage Taken by Illusion: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> \n Duration: 20 sec. \n Cooldown: 10 sec. \n Mana Cost: 50",
    "modifier_marci_16_0": "Casting Dispose on an ally throws them at the nearest enemy. Prioritizes heroes. \n\n Radius: 500 + 20% of Max Mana",
    "modifier_marci_16_1": "Casting Dispose on an ally throws them at the nearest enemy. Prioritizes heroes. \n\n Radius: <b><font color='#eabe10'>500</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b> of Max Mana",
