    "marci_companion_run": {
      "name": "Rebound",
      "description": "Marci bounds to the targeted allied unit, choosing a direction and distance she will spring away from it. Upon reaching the unit, Marci lunges to her final destination, damaging and stunning enemies where she lands.\\n\\nWhen Rebound is set to alt-cast, Marci brings the target ally with her to her final destination.\\n\\n The ally receives %ally_movespeed_pct%%% bonus movement speed for %ally_buff_duration%s.",
      "shard_description": "Increases damage. Rebound can be cast on enemies, and causes Marci to also get the speed boost when she casts it.",
      "facet_marci_pickmeup": "When Rebound is set to alt-cast, Marci brings the target ally with her to her final destination. The ally deals %ally_impact_damage_pct%%% of the Rebound damage to the enemies around it's destination.\\n\\n Will not apply to Rooted or Leashed allies.",
      "facet_marci_fleeting_fury": "If Marci has Unleash leveled, after landing from Rebound, Marci gains a %postjump_flurry_charges% strike Fury combo. If Unleash is already active, its duration is instead extended by %postjump_unleash_duration%s.\\n\\n If upgraded by Aghanim's Scepter, the resulting Unleashed pulse will not silence enemies.",
